c_diff --test xxhash_diff`.\nKeep runtime under ~150 s (HC level 12 is slow).\n\nReport back: the exact `#[test]` names, the final pass/fail line, a row-by-row table of\n94–167 -> covering test (or documented reason), and any divergence found plus the fix.","outputFile":"/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-ieCE1Y/tmp/claude-31072124/-local-home-scheschb--harvest-work-harvest-work-ieCE1Y-translated-rust/5bf83431-1376-4c81-bcb4-7fd267eb113b/tasks/a1324a29e1defa26b.output","canReadOutputFile":true}}
